      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. it definitely captures that grit. to make it even more impactful, can you add a part where he addresses the critics? like, he's talking about how the people calling him \"radical\" or \"hateful\" are actually the ones destroying the country by being too soft or indifferent. i want him to flip the script on them so the audience feels like the \"moderate\" side is actually the dangerous one. make it sound like his position is the only logical solution to avoid total chaos. maybe emphasize emphasize include some something about how the current system is just a slow-",
